<section class="solution section" id="solution">
  <div class="container">
    <span class="section__label gsap-fade-up" data-en="The Path Forward" data-hi="आगे का रास्ता">The Path Forward</span>
    <h2 class="section__title gsap-fade-up">
      <span data-en="Your Path to a" data-hi="आपका">Your Path to a</span> <span class="text-gradient" data-en="Healthier You" data-hi="स्वस्थ आप">Healthier You</span> <span data-en="" data-hi="बनने का रास्ता"></span>
    </h2>
    <p class="section__subtitle gsap-fade-up" data-en="Transformation isn't magic — it's method. Our proven 3-step approach has helped 800+ people achieve lasting results without extreme diets or unsustainable routines." data-hi="बदलाव जादू नहीं है — यह तरीक़ा है। हमारे आज़माए हुए 3-चरण दृष्टिकोण ने 800+ लोगों को बिना अत्यधिक डाइट या अस्थिर दिनचर्या के स्थायी परिणाम प्राप्त करने में मदद की है।">
      Transformation isn't magic — it's method. Our proven 3-step approach has helped 
      800+ people achieve lasting results without extreme diets or unsustainable routines.
    </p>

    <div class="solution__steps gsap-stagger-parent">
      <div class="solution__step gsap-stagger-child">
        <div class="solution__step-number">01</div>
        <div class="solution__step-icon">
          <svg width="40" height="40" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5">
            <circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"/>
            <path d="M12 16v-4M12 8h.01"/>
          </svg>
        </div>
        <h3 class="solution__step-title" data-en="Assess & Understand" data-hi="मूल्यांकन और समझ">Assess & Understand</h3>
        <p class="solution__step-text" data-en="We begin with a thorough assessment of your body composition, metabolic rate, lifestyle habits, medical history, and nutritional gaps. Understanding your unique physiology is the foundation of effective change." data-hi="हम आपके शरीर की संरचना, मेटाबॉलिक दर, जीवनशैली की आदतों, चिकित्सा इतिहास और पोषण संबंधी कमियों के गहन मूल्यांकन से शुरू करते हैं। आपकी अनूठी शारीरिक संरचना को समझना प्रभावी बदलाव की नींव है।">
          We begin with a thorough assessment of your body composition, metabolic rate, 
          lifestyle habits, medical history, and nutritional gaps. Understanding your 
          unique physiology is the foundation of effective change.
        </p>
        <ul class="solution__step-list">
          <li><span data-en="Body composition analysis" data-hi="शरीर संरचना विश्लेषण">Body composition analysis</span></li>
          <li><span data-en="Metabolic rate estimation" data-hi="मेटाबॉलिक दर का अनुमान">Metabolic rate estimation</span></li>
          <li><span data-en="Dietary habit evaluation" data-hi="खान-पान की आदतों का मूल्यांकन">Dietary habit evaluation</span></li>
          <li><span data-en="Lifestyle & stress assessment" data-hi="जीवनशैली और तनाव मूल्यांकन">Lifestyle & stress assessment</span></li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      <div class="solution__step gsap-stagger-child">
        <div class="solution__step-number">02</div>
        <div class="solution__step-icon">
          <svg width="40" height="40" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5">
            <path d="M14 2H6a2 2 0 0 0-2 2v16a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h12a2 2 0 0 0 2-2V8z"/>
            <polyline points="14 2 14 8 20 8"/>
            <line x1="16" y1="13" x2="8" y2="13"/>
            <line x1="16" y1="17" x2="8" y2="17"/>
            <polyline points="10 9 9 9 8 9"/>
          </svg>
        </div>
        <h3 class="solution__step-title" data-en="Personalized Plan" data-hi="व्यक्तिगत योजना">Personalized Plan</h3>
        <p class="solution__step-text" data-en="Based on your assessment, we create a 100% customized nutrition plan aligned with your goals, food preferences, and daily routine. No generic templates — every meal plan is crafted specifically for your body." data-hi="आपके मूल्यांकन के आधार पर, हम आपके लक्ष्यों, खाने की पसंद और दैनिक दिनचर्या के अनुसार 100% अनुकूलित पोषण योजना बनाते हैं। कोई सामान्य टेम्पलेट नहीं — हर भोजन योजना विशेष रूप से आपके शरीर के लिए बनाई जाती है।">
          Based on your assessment, we create a 100% customized nutrition plan aligned 
          with your goals, food preferences, and daily routine. No generic templates — 
          every meal plan is crafted specifically for your body.
        </p>
        <ul class="solution__step-list">
          <li><span data-en="Custom calorie & macro targets" data-hi="कस्टम कैलोरी और मैक्रो लक्ष्य">Custom calorie & macro targets</span></li>
          <li><span data-en="Meal plans with your favorite foods" data-hi="आपके पसंदीदा खाने के साथ भोजन योजना">Meal plans with your favorite foods</span></li>
          <li><span data-en="Progressive milestones" data-hi="प्रगतिशील मील के पत्थर">Progressive milestones</span></li>
          <li><span data-en="Supplement guidance (if needed)" data-hi="सप्लीमेंट मार्गदर्शन (ज़रूरत होने पर)">Supplement guidance (if needed)</span></li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      <div class="solution__step gsap-stagger-child">
        <div class="solution__step-number">03</div>
        <div class="solution__step-icon">
          <svg width="40" height="40" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5">
            <path d="M22 11.08V12a10 10 0 1 1-5.93-9.14"/>
            <polyline points="22 4 12 14.01 9 11.01"/>
          </svg>
        </div>
        <h3 class="solution__step-title" data-en="Transform & Sustain" data-hi="बदलाव और स्थिरता">Transform & Sustain</h3>
        <p class="solution__step-text" data-en="With weekly check-ins, plan adjustments, and continuous accountability, we guide you through every step. The goal isn't just to reach your target weight — it's to maintain it for life." data-hi="साप्ताहिक चेक-इन, योजना में बदलाव, और निरंतर जवाबदेही के साथ, हम आपको हर कदम पर मार्गदर्शन करते हैं। लक्ष्य सिर्फ़ अपने लक्षित वज़न तक पहुँचना नहीं है — बल्कि उसे जीवन भर बनाए रखना है।">
          With weekly check-ins, plan adjustments, and continuous accountability, 
          we guide you through every step. The goal isn't just to reach your target 
          weight — it's to maintain it for life.
        </p>
        <ul class="solution__step-list">
          <li><span data-en="Weekly progress tracking" data-hi="साप्ताहिक प्रगति ट्रैकिंग">Weekly progress tracking</span></li>
          <li><span data-en="Dynamic plan adjustments" data-hi="गतिशील योजना समायोजन">Dynamic plan adjustments</span></li>
          <li><span data-en="Habit formation coaching" data-hi="आदत निर्माण कोचिंग">Habit formation coaching</span></li>
          <li><span data-en="Long-term maintenance strategy" data-hi="दीर्घकालिक रखरखाव रणनीति">Long-term maintenance strategy</span></li>
        </ul>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- Connection lines between steps -->
  <div class="solution__connector"></div>
</section>

<style lang="scss">
  .solution {
    background: $color-bg-primary;
    position: relative;

    &__steps {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      gap: $space-8;

      @include respond-to('lg') {
        grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
        gap: $space-10;
      }
    }

    &__step {
      @include card-base;
      position: relative;
      padding: $space-10 $space-8;
      text-align: left;
      background: $gradient-card;

      &:hover {
        .solution__step-icon {
          transform: scale(1.1);
          box-shadow: $shadow-glow-emerald;
        }
      }

      &-number {
        position: absolute;
        top: $space-6;
        right: $space-6;
        font-family: $font-heading;
        font-size: $fs-5xl;
        font-weight: $fw-black;
        color: rgba($color-accent-emerald, 0.06);
        line-height: 1;
      }

      &-icon {
        @include flex-center;
        width: 72px;
        height: 72px;
        background: rgba($color-accent-emerald, 0.1);
        border: 1px solid rgba($color-accent-emerald, 0.2);
        border-radius: $radius-xl;
        color: $color-accent-emerald;
        margin-bottom: $space-6;
        transition: all $transition-smooth;
      }

      &-title {
        @include heading($fs-xl);
        margin-bottom: $space-3;
      }

      &-text {
        @include body-text;
        margin-bottom: $space-6;
      }

      &-list {
        display: flex;
        flex-direction: column;
        gap: $space-2;

        li {
          display: flex;
          align-items: center;
          gap: $space-3;
          font-size: $fs-sm;
          color: $color-text-secondary;

          &::before {
            content: '';
            width: 6px;
            height: 6px;
            border-radius: 50%;
            background: $color-accent-emerald;
            flex-shrink: 0;
          }
        }
      }
    }
  }
</style>
